"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products,\n"
"            sale orders and more."
msgstr ""
"En important les données de démonstration de ce module, votre base de "
"données a été remplie de quelques produits,\n"
"            de réservations et plus encore."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "Facturez votre client pour le montant dû, et c’est tout !"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "Facturer vos invités"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guests who stayed in each room. "
"Then confirm the number of city taxes to be charged, which updates the "
"delivered city tax count."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez et ajustez si nécessaire le nombre de clients ayant séjourné dans "
"chaque chambre. Confirmez ensuite le nombre de taxes de séjour à facturer, "
"ce qui mettra à jour le nombre de taxes de séjour appliquées."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "Enregistrement des arrivées"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "Enregistrement des départs"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check information and then confirm the booking."
msgstr "Vérifiez les informations puis confirmez la réservation."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "Vérifiez les données de la facture et confirmez."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Check-in is from 3:00 PM and check-out is until 11:00 AM. Early or late "
"arrangements can often be made on request."
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"Les taxes de séjour doivent être facturées sur les nuits réellement passées "
"et non théoriques et sont calculées comme la somme des nuits effectuées par "
"chaque client."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the room to book."
msgstr "Cliquez sur l’une des chambres pour réserver."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr "Cliquez sur le bouton Check in pour confirmer leur séjour !"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur le bouton Check out pour indiquer qu’ils vous ont rendu les clés."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "Cliquez sur Créer une réservation pour ouvrir le formulaire."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Invoice button with a full invoice."
